> 
> In summary, acknowledging the significance of governance, understanding the interplay between public and private sectors, utilizing existing tools and frameworks, and embracing robust decision-making practices will empower us to effectively close adaptation gaps and safeguard our communities against the often unpredictable impacts of climate change.
